Third-party threat-model references:

The `llm-features` rule domain (LLM-001 through LLM-005) draws its threat
model from the Strix project's `llm_prompt_injection` skill:

- Strix (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/usestrix/strix
  `strix/skills/vulnerabilities/llm_prompt_injection.md`

Used as a written reference for the prompt-injection attack surface
(direct injection, indirect/RAG injection, tool-call abuse, insecure
output handling) and for its "severity follows the sink" calibration.
No Strix source code, agent runtime, or offensive tooling is included in
or derived by this project. Apache-2.0 attribution is provided here in
